------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of this repository are derived from the third-party projects listed
below. The corresponding sources are named in README.md under "Dependencies &
Submodules". Where an upstream project distributes its own NOTICE or license
text, the full text is preserved by the upstream repository and applies to the
derived portions in this project.

  RoPE - rotary positional embeddings for the transformer encoder
  https://github.com/lucidrains/rotary-embedding-torch

  Mix-LN - for cross-speaker and cross-lingual learning
  https://www.isca-archive.org/interspeech_2024/hwang24_interspeech.pdf

  HiFi-GAN - for waveform reconstruction
  https://github.com/jik876/hifi-gan

  NSF (Neural Source-Filter) - for waveform reconstruction
  https://github.com/nii-yamagishilab/project-NN-Pytorch-scripts

  pc-ddsp - for waveform reconstruction
  https://github.com/yxlllc/pc-ddsp

  RMVPE - for pitch extraction
  https://github.com/Dream-High/RMVPE

  Vocal Remover - for harmonic-noise separation
  https://github.com/tsurumeso/vocal-remover

This project is a refactored version of the original DiffSinger implementation
(https://github.com/MoonInTheRiver/DiffSinger) and cites the paper
"DiffSinger: Singing Voice Synthesis via Shallow Diffusion Mechanism"
(https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.02446).

